// pmpro-stack: after every apt transaction, restart any stack service that a
// postinst left enabled-but-dead (an apache2 postinst stop/start race can
// leave Apache down until someone notices). Turns that class of failure from
// an outage into a syslog line (tag pmpro-service-guard).
DPkg::Post-Invoke { "[ -x /usr/local/bin/pmpro-apt-service-guard ] && /usr/local/bin/pmpro-apt-service-guard || true"; };
